### 20.4 Paired diff (DCT_on − DCT_off, 동일 step)

| step | ΔSR_old | Δclose5 | Δclose2 | ΔminLat | ΔfinLat | Δang | Δsafety |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| ck500  | +0.0pp | +0.0pp | −3.7pp  | −0.09mm | −0.09mm | −0.04° | −0.22mm |
